  _description: The fox-passport induction arc (closed elder -> open elder -> thanks). Arc - it must
    survive a whole run of slow play while the hero hunts a fox part, so it is expiry-exempt.
    Resolution stays empty (an arc may run the whole run); note the authoring gotcha - a resolution
    fact must be one written AT the payoff beat, never the fact that GATES the payoff beat, or the
    thread retires before its finale can place.
